cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use thoth, please cite it as below, together with the GIAB truth sets,
  stratifications and comparison tools it runs (see "Citing" in README.md).
title: thoth
abstract: >-
  A pipeline-neutral GIAB benchmarking harness: scores every caller's VCFs
  against every applicable GIAB truth set, small variants with hap.py/vcfeval,
  stratified, and structural variants with truvari.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Haagmans
    given-names: Martin
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/martinandclaude/thoth"
url: "https://martinandclaude.github.io/thoth/"
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - variant calling
  - Genome in a Bottle
  - Snakemake
